<title>USA: Cornerstone sets stock buyback program.</title>
<headline>Cornerstone sets stock buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cornerstone Imaging Inc on Thursday said its board of directors has authorized the use of up to $5 million to repurchase company common stock from time to time in the open market or through private deals.</p>
<p>The repurchased stock is expected to be held by the company as treasury stock to meet Cornerstone's obligations under its stock plans and for other corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The company intends to use cash to fund its purchases.</p>
</text>
